<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠλᾰκ-τέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be observed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόνοια τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1180
				</span></i>
			; (from 
				Med.
			) <i>to be guarded against,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλακτέον,</span>
			<i>one must observe, obey,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					620
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must preserve,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρεσβεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.99J.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (from 
				Med.
			) <i>one must guard against,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				499
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1109b7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. μή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				416a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως μή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.36
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				6.94
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο πράττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					2.31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
